                                "sense_id": "abbda6c1-90eb-36ff-8a7c-70625ca27ed3",
                                "text": "In some parts of the house were all the comforts of elbowings, shufflings, crammings and squeezings, and on the outside all the racket that was possible of screaming women, and wrangling coachmen […]"
